WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.404
Hi there!

2
00:00:02.405 --> 00:00:06.119
Who are

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.219
you? I'm a

4
00:00:09.220 --> 00:00:13.010
baboon. Baboons are

5
00:00:13.011 --> 00:00:17.330
large monkeys. Where do

6
00:00:17.331 --> 00:00:20.073
you live? We live

7
00:00:20.074 --> 00:00:24.065
in Africa and Arabia. We like

8
00:00:24.066 --> 00:00:27.989
forests and savannas. What do

9
00:00:27.990 --> 00:00:30.455
you eat? We eat

10
00:00:30.456 --> 00:00:34.155
plants and meat. We

11
00:00:34.156 --> 00:00:37.881
like fruit, insects, and bark. Sometimes

12
00:00:37.882 --> 00:00:42.269
we eat birds or even sheep. You

13
00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:45.844
climb trees, right? We

14
00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:49.168
usually stay on the ground. But

15
00:00:49.169 --> 00:00:53.166
we climb trees to watch for enemies. We

16
00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:57.073
also sleep in trees. You

17
00:00:57.074 --> 00:01:01.368
live in a big group! Most

18
00:01:01.369 --> 00:01:05.069
baboons live in groups. We

19
00:01:05.070 --> 00:01:10.696
talk to each other by making sounds. Do

20
00:01:10.697 --> 00:01:15.050
baboons help each other? We

21
00:01:15.051 --> 00:01:19.736
remove dirt and bugs from each other.

22
00:01:19.737 --> 00:01:21.908
This keeps us clean.

23
00:01:21.909 --> 00:01:25.343
Do you have any enemies?

24
00:01:25.344 --> 00:01:29.072
Yes! We have many enemies.

25
00:01:29.073 --> 00:01:33.593
Big cats like cheetahs and lions hunt us.

26
00:01:33.594 --> 00:01:39.344
So do people.

27
00:01:39.345 --> 00:01:43.235
I see some tasty bark.

28
00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.548
See you later.

29
00:01:46.549 --> 00:01:52.990
Bye-bye, Baboon!

